{In the 3rd Chapter we already got familiar with the pin. There we delivered
checkmates in one move with the help of a pin while now we need to try to find
the way to win material with this motif.} 1. Bc4 $18 {White takes the rook
next move as it is pinned and cannot move.} *

[Event "?"]
[Site "?"]
[Date "????.??.??"]
[Round "?"]
[White "The pin"]
[Black "example 2"]
[Result "*"]
[SetUp "1"]
[FEN "6k1/4p2p/6q1/8/R7/4B2P/5P2/6K1 w - - 0 1"]
[PlyCount "1"]
[SourceDate "2018.03.29"]

{Black has material advantage for the moment but after} 1. Rg4 $18 {White wins
the queen with his rook as it cannot leave because of the pin. The same is
true on the opposite way, the rook is also pinned, but of course this deal
favors White as the queen gets lost and it is more valuable than the rook. Try
to solve the following exercises with the help of a pin.} *

